  "content": "<h2>云靴</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q2CUAyS.png\" alt=\"cloudbootsbanner\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/f8Nnj5VuFj\" style=\"display:inline-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-singular_64h.png\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftiviacz1337\" style=\"display:inline-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_64h.png\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<h2>功能</h2>\n<p><strong>云靴</strong> - 旧版本的云靴（无法获取）<br>\n<strong>铁云靴</strong> - 额外5%速度，跳跃提升II，免疫摔落伤害<br>\n<strong>金云靴</strong> - 额外10%速度，跳跃提升III，免疫摔落伤害<br>\n<strong>钻石云靴</strong> - 额外15%速度，跳跃提升IV，免疫摔落伤害<br>\n<strong>下界合金云靴</strong> - 额外20%速度，跳跃提升V，免疫摔落伤害</p>\n<p><strong>金羽毛</strong> - 如果玩家在主手或副手持握该物品，则授予<strong>免疫摔落伤害</strong>的效果。金羽毛拥有385点耐久度。可以使用金锭进行修复。如果安装了Curios API或Trinkets（Trinkets 1.17.1+），可以佩戴在饰品栏位中。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3WiRD6M.png\" alt=\"atlas\"></p>\n<h2>合成表</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>金羽毛</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a4PCgJ0.png\" alt=\"recipe2\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>云靴</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UhwRraX.gif\" alt=\"recipe\"></p>",
